<li><a href="/scarborough">Scarborough</a> — Local market consumer intelligence from Nielsen.</li>
<li><a href="/resonate">Resonate</a> — Consumer intelligence and audience segmentation.</li>
</ul>

<p>See the full <a href="/commspoint-influence/alternatives">Commspoint Influence alternatives</a> page for a broader comparison.</p>

<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

<h3>Does Commspoint Influence publish pricing?</h3>
<p>No. Pricing is custom-quoted by Nielsen.</p>

<h3>Is Commspoint Influence sold separately?</h3>
<p>It may be evaluated as a standalone planning solution or as part of a broader Nielsen planning and measurement suite. Confirm packaging with Nielsen.</p>

<h3>What affects the price?</h3>
<p>Users, markets, category coverage, datasets, support level, and bundled Nielsen products can all affect pricing.</p>

<h3>Is it a media buying platform?</h3>
<p>No. Commspoint Influence is a strategic channel planning and optimization tool, not a buying or execution platform.</p>

<h3>How does it differ from Commspoint Journey?</h3>
<p>Influence focuses on channel mix decisions. Journey focuses on the consumer path to purchase and touchpoint influence across the decision journey.</p>

